VlQ29tbWVudDgwNjI1NDYyMg==","user":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-03-24T23:45:43Z","updated_at":"2021-03-24T23:45:43Z","body":"This is a bug in sqlalchemy, in the reflection select. Sadly the pg_catalog table of postgress are not very user friendly to work with.\r\nAlas the fix is trivial.\r\n\r\nReproduction without alembic:\r\n```py\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Column, Integer, Identity, Table\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import declarative_base\r\nimport sqlalchemy as sa\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\r\n\r\nengine = create_engine(\"postgresql://scott:tiger@127.0.0.1:5432/test\")\r\nBase = declarative_base()\r\nclass A(Base):\r\n    \"\"\"example definition table\"\"\"\r\n    __tablename__ = \"Example\"\r\n    id = Column(Integer, Identity(), primary_key=True)\r\nclass B(Base):\r\n    \"\"\"example definition table\"\"\"\r\n\r\n    __tablename__ = \"example\"\r\n    id = Column(Integer, Identity(), primary_key=True)\r\nBase.metadata.drop_all(engine)\r\nBase.metadata.create_all(engine)\r\nisp = sa.inspect(engine)\r\nprint(isp.get_columns('Example'))\r\nprint(isp.get_columns('example'))\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/806254622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4506613967,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ0NTA2NjEzOTY3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/events/4506613967","actor":{"login":"CaselIT","id":16175304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTc1MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16175304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT","html_url":"https://github.com/CaselIT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CaselIT/subscriptions","organiz